flowchart TB
 NEW[New or updated CC] --> AD[Admission: release and environment qualification]
 AD --> POOL[Eligible capability pool]
 POOL --> B[Bind required checks]
 B --> I[Input and effect checks]
 I --> RUN[Execute within enforced limits]
 RUN --> O[Output and scientific evidence checks]
 O -->|Pass| OK[Accept evidence]
 O -->|Fail or inconclusive| REC[Bounded repair, new approach or human input]
 REC --> B
 I & RUN & O -. every-call receipt .-> F[Circulation: usage, issues and drift]
 F --> RE[Reevaluate qualification]
 RE -->|Still qualified| POOL
 RE -->|Suspend or retire| OUT[Leave active pool; retain history]
 OK --> AG[Agent revises research agenda]
